{"unit_id":"guo6x__dsh-pilot#card-zh","repo":"guo6x/dsh-pilot","commit":"a1dc0b37b492a4243ac8e95dabdcda9958414ac0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pilot 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的浏览器自动化插件，通过 CDP 控制本机 Edge 或 Chrome，并在侧边栏提供可拖动的驾驶舱面板。它为 agent 注册 17 个工具，支持打开网页、读取带编号交互元素的文本快照、点击和输入、表单填写、文件上传、页面等待与校验、截图和下载；每个会话各用一个浏览器实例。适合需要在 DSH 对话中浏览网页、操作表单或查看页面变化的人。需要 Node.js 22 及本机 Edge 或 Chrome；无需 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1122-1386","lib/client.js:108-249","lib/index.js:229-258"]}
{"unit_id":"guo6x__dsh-pilot#card-en","repo":"guo6x/dsh-pilot","commit":"a1dc0b37b492a4243ac8e95dabdcda9958414ac0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pilot lets DSH Web agents control local Edge or Chrome. Its tools read numbered page snapshots, interact with elements and forms, verify page conditions, and capture or download content. A draggable cockpit shows the browser; each session has its own instance. Requires Node.js 22; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1122-1386","lib/client.js:108-249","lib/index.js:229-258"]}
