{"unit_id":"guo6x__dsh-pilot#feature-1","repo":"guo6x/dsh-pilot","commit":"a1dc0b37b492a4243ac8e95dabdcda9958414ac0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pilot 的功能「结构化页面快照」：读取网页标题、URL、可见文字、链接和编号交互元素，并附上与前次快照的变化摘要。agent 调用 pilot_open 或 pilot_snapshot 获取页面信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:347-394","lib/index.js:1128-1157"]}
{"unit_id":"guo6x__dsh-pilot#feature-2","repo":"guo6x/dsh-pilot","commit":"a1dc0b37b492a4243ac8e95dabdcda9958414ac0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pilot 的功能「网页交互」：按快照编号或 CSS 选择器点击网页元素、填写输入框并发送按键。agent 可用这组操作完成导航、搜索或提交表单。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:514-565","lib/index.js:693-717","lib/index.js:1169-1248"]}
{"unit_id":"guo6x__dsh-pilot#feature-3","repo":"guo6x/dsh-pilot","commit":"a1dc0b37b492a4243ac8e95dabdcda9958414ac0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pilot 的功能「批量填写表单」：根据 label、aria-label、placeholder、name 或 id 匹配文本框、文本域和下拉框，一次填入多项并返回成功与失败项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:566-653","lib/index.js:1200-1223"]}
{"unit_id":"guo6x__dsh-pilot#feature-4","repo":"guo6x/dsh-pilot","commit":"a1dc0b37b492a4243ac8e95dabdcda9958414ac0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pilot 的功能「上传文件」：把本地绝对路径文件交给网页文件输入框，支持按快照编号或选择器定位；一次最多十个文件，总大小不超过 100 MB。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:655-691","lib/index.js:1224-1238"]}
{"unit_id":"guo6x__dsh-pilot#feature-5","repo":"guo6x/dsh-pilot","commit":"a1dc0b37b492a4243ac8e95dabdcda9958414ac0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pilot 的功能「页面导航与等待」：打开网址、后退、刷新或等待指定文字、可见元素和 URL 条件，操作后可立即检查条件是否满足。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:324-345","lib/index.js:416-512","lib/index.js:1250-1323"]}
{"unit_id":"guo6x__dsh-pilot#feature-6","repo":"guo6x/dsh-pilot","commit":"a1dc0b37b492a4243ac8e95dabdcda9958414ac0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pilot 的功能「实时浏览器驾驶舱」：在 DSH Web 侧边栏打开可拖动面板，查看页面截图、地址、状态和操作记录，并启动、关闭或切换查看的 agent 会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:108-249","lib/index.js:1133-1200"]}
{"unit_id":"guo6x__dsh-pilot#feature-7","repo":"guo6x/dsh-pilot","commit":"a1dc0b37b492a4243ac8e95dabdcda9958414ac0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pilot 的功能「截图与页面脚本」：将当前页面保存为 PNG，也可在页面上下文执行 JavaScript 并取回 JSON 结果，供需要视觉或读取 DOM 以外状态的任务使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:719-729","lib/index.js:731-750","lib/index.js:1324-1344"]}
