{"unit_id":"guo6x__dsh-pilot#caveat-1","repo":"guo6x/dsh-pilot","commit":"a1dc0b37b492a4243ac8e95dabdcda9958414ac0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pilot 需要 Node.js 22 和本机 Edge 或 Chrome；默认 headless，可用 DSH_PILOT_HEADED 或 headed 配置开启可见窗口。（见 lib/index.js:189-190）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:189-190","lib/index.js:229-258"]}
{"unit_id":"guo6x__dsh-pilot#caveat-2","repo":"guo6x/dsh-pilot","commit":"a1dc0b37b492a4243ac8e95dabdcda9958414ac0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"README 称插件仅支持 headless；实现也支持通过 DSH_PILOT_HEADED 或 headed 配置开启有头模式。（见 README.md:95-99、lib/index.js:189-190）","source":"generated","evidence":["README.md:95-99","lib/index.js:189-190"]}
